      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eakly%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Eakly thrived as a farming community despite lacking a railroad and a registered town plat for its first two decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eakly%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Because no town plat was filed until the 1920s, most people who wanted to build in Eakly had to lease land.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eakly%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Cotton farming dominated early decades in Eakly, but peanut farming became the leading agricultural activity by the 1960s.",
